         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### We are human, but different\n\nThere are no people exactly like others; not even twin brothers can be considered completely alike.\n\nIn this scenario, we need to understand who we are and how we learn so that we can increase our knowledge.\n\nIn this lesson, we will get to know ourselves better.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "936de977-cb36-44b2-acba-de5ca9358d75",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "936de977-cb36-44b2-acba-de5ca9358d75",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "81e9393b-d5b6-4b04-91bd-417e943d3e97",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=2a2cbd69-7f09-4a58-aff1-6fbff8c5bda5",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Comparisons\n\nMany times in life we end up simplifying some things, but these simplifications can end up leading us to mistakes.\n\nAn example of this is the understanding of **intelligence**.\n\nFor example, we can find people saying that one person is more intelligent than another, and this deserves reflection.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "b47c31bc-4b61-468d-a7e3-8797a55abe30",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "b47c31bc-4b61-468d-a7e3-8797a55abe30",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Is there only one type of intelligence?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "4a63236c-8398-4263-82a5-0f5b706eae91",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "No",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "4a63236c-8398-4263-82a5-0f5b706eae91",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [
            {
