            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "81e9393b-d5b6-4b04-91bd-417e943d3e97",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=2a2cbd69-7f09-4a58-aff1-6fbff8c5bda5",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Expanding the horizon\n\nFor a long time, **intelligence** was not well understood by people and, as a consequence, we believed there was only one type of intelligence.\n\nAs a result, we had unfair comparisons and did not create tools that would help everyone learn.\n\nBut research such as Howard Gardner's helped us understand that there are different types of intelligences.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
