          {
            "text": "#### Understanding the chart\n\nOur different types of intelligence make some people learn better by reading, others by drawing, others by dancing.\n\nFor some, it is necessary to have someone close by; others can learn on their own.\n\nWith this, this app made a decision...",
            "source": [],
